<mj-text>
  It is smart to open a second pillar as well. When you put aside 2% of your salary, the state
  adds 4% from social tax: two euros for every euro of yours. The contributions are free of
  income tax. Tuleva's second pillar fund is a low-fee index fund.
</mj-text>
<mj-text><strong>Opening a second pillar takes a couple of minutes in the Tuleva web app:</strong></mj-text>
<mj-button href="https://pension.tuleva.ee/2nd-pillar-flow?language=en&utm_content=nudge_second_pillar_start">
  Open a second pillar
</mj-button>
